  snapped neighbours meet: true, last edge 100
  whole points at scale 1: true
  half points at scale 2: true
  mirror is exact: true
  fit answers 100x58
== cost ==
  asks per leaf at depth 2: 3
  asks per leaf at depth 4: 3
  asks per leaf at depth 6: 3
  and it does not grow with depth: true
== remeasuring ==
  first solve sizes it at what it measured: true
  a leaf that grew is solved again, not remembered: true
  and its neighbour moved with it: true
